1
00:00:01,173 --> 00:00:02,813
After "Dubki" they take you

2
00:00:02,813 --> 00:00:04,123
to your military registration office,

3
00:00:04,123 --> 00:00:06,173
they issue you a military

4
00:00:06,173 --> 00:00:10,103
ID there, you become a serviceman.

5
00:00:10,103 --> 00:00:13,573
And if you flee,

6
00:00:13,573 --> 00:00:15,933
then you are already subject to

7
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:17,053
not administrative

8
00:00:17,053 --> 00:00:19,783
liability, but criminal.

9
00:00:19,783 --> 00:00:21,233
In my opinion,

10
00:00:21,233 --> 00:00:23,133
today it's 5 to 10 years.

11
00:00:25,193 --> 00:00:29,167
Simply from wherever you flee

12
00:00:29,167 --> 00:00:30,577
with a military ID,

13
00:00:30,577 --> 00:00:33,367
you fall under an article

14
00:00:33,367 --> 00:00:34,677
of the criminal code.

15
00:00:34,677 --> 00:00:39,507
Today these people are not imprisoned,

16
00:00:39,507 --> 00:00:40,147
no one investigates,

17
00:00:40,147 --> 00:00:41,607
because there are simply too many of them.
